🎬 Media & Entertainment Portal (Python GUI Application)
A modern Python desktop application built with CustomTkinter for a sleek, dark-themed user interface, utilizing CSV as a lightweight local database for user authentication and media record management.

  🚀 Key Features

1. Secure User Authentication:
 * Login System: Validates credentials against the local user_data.csv data store.
 * User Registration: Allows new users to sign up with automatic duplicate username checks.

2. Modern Dashboard & Media Management:
 * Add media items categorized by type (Video, Music, Games).
 * Real-time table view using a customized CTkTextbox for organized data display.

3. Smooth UI Transitions:
 * Includes custom fade-in effects and screen transition handlers for an enhanced user experience.

🛠️ Tech Stack

 * Programming Language: Python 3.11+
 * GUI Framework: CustomTkinter (customtkinter)
 * Data Storage: CSV (csv module)
 * Environment: PyCharm IDE / Virtual Environment (.venv311)

⚙️ Installation & Setup Guide

 * Open the project folder in PyCharm.
 * Ensure your interpreter is set to Python 3.11+ (e.g., .venv311).
 * Install dependencies by opening the Terminal in PyCharm (Alt + F12) and running:
    > pip install customtkinter

Run the Application:
Execute GUI.py directly through PyCharm or via the terminal:

python GUI.py

📂 Project Structure

PythonProject19/
